---
title: VideoHub Upload Video - Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VideoController
    participant AuthService
    participant VideoService
    participant Database

    User->>VideoController: POST /api/videos (title, description, url, token)
    VideoController->>AuthService: validateToken(token)
    AuthService-->>VideoController: userId or null

    break token invalid
        VideoController-->>User: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    VideoController->>VideoController: validate input (title, format)

    break title empty or invalid format
        VideoController-->>User: 400 Bad Request
    end

    VideoController->>VideoService: uploadVideo(userId, title, description, url)
    VideoService->>Database: findByAuthorAndUrl(authorId = userId, url)
    Database-->>VideoService: video or not found

    break duplicate found
        VideoService-->>VideoController: conflict
        VideoController-->>User: 409 Conflict
    end

    VideoService->>Database: createVideo(authorId = userId, title, description, url)
    Database-->>VideoService: videoId
    VideoService-->>VideoController: videoId
    VideoController-->>User: 201 Created (videoId)
